{"schema":"LAW_EN_DOCUMENT_V1","id":"i18n-e3a81b9e28d9be03d26e43ee25abdf9b659915b146f42924","family_id":"KR:013220","country":"KR","language":"en","title":"ENFORCEMENT DECREE OF THE ACT ON MANAGEMENT OF FIREFIGHTING EQUIPMENT","title_original":"소방장비관리법 시행령","kind":"대통령령","source_version":"287377","promulgated":null,"effective":null,"translation_status":"AI_DRAFT","body_status":"BODY_LOADED","source_url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/lsInfoP.do?lsiSeq=287377","source_sha256":"5ec8ed6d9986beb9b06e27df3fdfd117ffbb23733f907e5568d570449f38d7fc","body_sha256":"17b8999437701e18130394dc9cd3fba7066d945b57ee107c12eb349b17c0860b","article_count":1,"full_text":"Article 39 (Requirement for Designation as Fire Equipment Maintenance Center) “Institution or organization qualified for requirements prescribed by Presidential Decree, such as professional human resources and facilities, etc.” in Article 36 (1) of the Act means an institution or organization qualified under the following requirements:\n  1. It shall have at least five professionals falling under any of the following:\n    (a) A person who has acquired a bachelor’s degree in fire-equipment majors designated and publicly notified by the Fire Commissioner of the National Fire Agency (including anyone recognized to hold similar or higher academic backgrounds in accordance with other statutes or regulations) and has at least three years’ working experience at a corporation or institution related to fire equipment;\n    (b) A person who has at least five years’ working experience in affairs related to businesses under Article 36 (2) of the Act at a corporation or institution related to fire equipment.\n  2. It shall have at least two assistants with at least five years’ working experience in affairs related to businesses under Article 36 (2) of the Act;\n  3. It shall be equipped with facilities and equipment designated and publicly notified by the Fire Commissioner of the National Fire Agency.","metadata":{"author_checks":["All current held source unit text, source editorial notes, amounts, periods, exceptions and source omission boundaries compared.","Unchanged official English retained only in the recorded exact source/target spans; original row, role, provider, edition, links and receipts remain unchanged.","New affected units are MACHINE_TRANSLATION / UNREVIEWED; source graphics remain linked to actual unchanged assets.","Source unit keys, order and full-text SHA matched the frozen inventory."],"author_method":"Exact verified reuse of existing official English spans plus assistant-authored corrections/new material, with original rows/roles/receipts preserved.","author_self_check_record":{"path":"\\\\100.90.87.105\\YOLLA-D\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1521_KR013050\\translations\\decree\\en.units.parts\\article-39.selfcheck.json","sha256":"7babbe1053eea0b0d7f2154630056acad5615fcaf603cbe3372bdbbab414fa7d"},"body_and_addenda_complete":false,"component_id":"DECREE:kr-013220-287377-ko","component_ids":["DECREE:kr-013220-287377-ko:article-39"],"component_kind":"DECREE","edition_id":"edition-5ab2a19b19eb0df0623363b4150efed54ea5b269bce5b268","english_gap_scope_plan":{"path":"\\\\100.90.87.105\\YOLLA-D\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1521_KR013050\\direct_ingest_v1\\english_gap_scope_plan_v1.json","reason":{"changes":[{"new_text":"It shall have at least two assistants","old_text":"It shall have more than two assistants","reason":"Preserve the inclusive minimum of two."}],"reason":"The source requires two or more assistants, not more than two.","status":"MINIMAL_REPAIR_REQUIRED"},"sha256":"dd2aeb30cb330259f4484b257d488e158de312d85310a6a15ba664da7e6072c7"},"human_or_official_review_claimed":false,"multilingual_schema":"20261018_multilingual_v1","parent_family_id":"KR:013050","parent_ordinal":1521,"payload_scope_id":"DECREE:kr-01322